## Verification
1. Contracted project: emit a templ file with `selected={}` -> REQUIREMENTS,
   nothing queued.
2. Emit an hx-target id absent from the contract -> REQUIREMENTS.
3. Emit a view-conditional header fragment without OOB coverage ->
   REQUIREMENTS.
4. layout_manifest(players, browse) matches the served page on ids/classes
   (spot check).
5. A project without a contract: emits behave exactly as today.
